{
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "tfm2_blockcraft_steve": {
        "name": "Steve",
        "skill": "Build: wall, piston, web, TNT, water or lava. Prepare a crystal or anchor using two reserved charges, then deploy and detonate it. Three shared charges recover separately in five seconds. Heavy blasts can hurt Steve and are blocked by walls.",
        "skill2": "Utility: fishing rod, ender pearl, golden apple, shield, crossbow, axe or short boat. Each recipe has its own cooldown and spends one shared charge. Steve improves healing, shields and newly built object health. Herobrine turns a confirmed champion utility hit into one target-bound melee follow-up.",
        "ult": "Boat Wall: commit a warned path, then ride while the wall rises. Steve builds straight; Herobrine can build open curves. Jump off early while the empty boat finishes. Ice speeds allies. Change Form is a separate native action: 0.4 second preparation, 12 second base cooldown after ultimate unlock. It never spends this ultimate."
      }
    }
  }
}
